;; Subject vocabularies that say what an image shows. Iconclass classifies the
;; content of images: a subject an Iconclass notation names is depicted. Any
;; other vocabulary (GND subject headings, AAT, a local thesaurus) says what a
;; work is about, not that it is shown (post-audit 8, rules study).
{:id     :lido/subject-schemes
 :source "Iconclass (iconclass.org), a classification of the subjects of images"
 :concepts
 {:subject/ofness
  {:doc      "An Iconclass notation: iconographic content, what the image represents."
   :patterns ["^https?://(?:www\\.)?iconclass\\.org/"]}}}
